- IN vs EXISTS
- NOT IN vs NOT EXISTS
- GROUP BY vs window functions
- UNION vs UNION ALL
- DELETE vs TRUNCATE vs DROP
- indexes
- composite indexes
- covering indexes
- sargability
- execution plans
- cardinality
- query optimization
- timestamp boundaries
- timezone issues
- integer division
- duplicate rows
