# 110. Top 100 SQL Interview Questions

> Category: 12-Interview-and-Scenarios · Section 110
> Cross-references: [103-SQL-Problem-Solving-Framework](103-SQL-Problem-Solving-Framework.md), [09-NULL-and-Logic](../02-NULL-and-Logic/09-NULL-Deep-Dive.md), [15-INNER-JOIN](../03-Joins/15-INNER-JOIN.md), [33-CTEs](../04-Subqueries/33-CTEs.md), [44-Window-Functions-Basics](../06-Window-Functions/44-Window-Functions-Basics.md), [72-Indexes-Basics](../09-Optimization/72-Indexes-Basics.md)

This section contains **100 of the most commonly asked SQL interview questions**, drawn from real interviews at tech companies, LeetCode, HackerRank, and StrataScratch. Each question includes:

- The problem statement
- A **BAD APPROACH** (common mistake)
- A **BETTER APPROACH** (correct solution)
- Expected output
- NULL behavior, edge cases, and performance notes
- An **Interview trap** label where applicable

The questions use a **single shared schema** so you can run every example against the same data.

